roles and responsibilities:

## 1. Super Admin (Internal VicAI Platform Owner / Staff)
Operates the internal admin portal to run the whole platform.
- **Tenant portfolio view** — sees all organisations, their tier, lifecycle status, health score
- **Health & monitoring** — tracks billing, channels, integrations, usage, AI quality, engagement per tenant
- **Service control ("kill-switches")** — pause/suspend/resume tenant services with impact preview, reason logging, audit trail
- **Billing & usage management** — reviews usage ledgers, applies adjustments/credits, resolves discrepancies, approves invoice snapshots to Xero
- **Support & diagnostics** — replays failed webhooks, views vendor logs (Telnyx, Stripe), uses time-limited audited impersonation to troubleshoot in a customer's portal

## 2. Admin (Customer Organisation Admin)
Operates the branded customer portal to run their own business.
- **Self-service onboarding** — registers, verifies email, picks a plan, enters payment via Stripe
- **Business configuration** — locations, trading hours, services, escalation contacts, FAQs/documents
- **Integration centre** — connects telephony, SMS, email, socials, business software via OAuth/keys
- **AI agent setup** — defines identity, brand tone, tool constraints, handover rules
- **Reply controls** — sets AI behaviour per channel (human only / AI drafts / conditional auto-send / AI-first with handover)
- **Testing & go-live** — sandbox tests the agent, then requests production activation
- **Ongoing management** — invites staff with RBAC, monitors dashboards, manages reputation/review replies

## 3. Customer (End-User/Client)
Interacts only through external channels — never logs into a portal.
- **Omnichannel inbound** — contacts the business via phone, SMS, web chat, email, or social
- **AI interaction** — gets answered/qualified/booked by the AI agent using its constrained knowledge base
- **Seamless handover** — AI hands off to a human when it hits complex questions, restricted wording, or a direct request for a human; human sees full context/transcript in the unified inbox
- **Proactive follow-up** — receives an automated SMS/email review request after job completion
- **Review loop** — if they leave a Google review, it's ingested back in; AI analyzes sentiment and drafts a reply for approval, with priority escalation triggered for negative (1–3 star) reviews
